  "rationale": "Serenity 0.12.5's WebSocket dependency path uses the rustls 0.22 compatibility line and resolves rustls-webpki 0.102.8. A fixed compatible line requires an upstream Serenity/tokio-tungstenite/rustls migration; replacing portable rustls or carrying a local cryptographic fork is outside this approved slice.",
